WEBVTT

00:00:59.204 --> 00:01:02.180
na washindi wanstahili ushindi wao.

00:01:02.927 --> 00:01:06.743
Huu ndio kiini cha 
wazo la ustahi.

00:01:07.849 --> 00:01:11.331
Kwa vitendo,bila shaka, tuna upungufu.

00:01:12.581 --> 00:01:15.986
Si kila mtu ana nafasi sawa kuinuka.

00:01:17.006 --> 00:01:21.918
Watoto wazaliwao kwa jamii maskini
hukua kwa umaskini,

00:01:22.648 --> 00:01:27.535
Wazazi tajiri wana uwezo
kupitisha manufaa kwa wototo wao.

00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:31.607
Kwa mfano, katika vyuo bora zaidi,